    {
      "id": "claim_146d4170ba854d6d8f27e3cc012721a2",
      "statement": "ExtendedModelResponse allows middleware to return a Command alongside the model response; commands from multiple middleware are accumulated (inner-to-outer order) and applied sequentially to state after the model node completes; messages in commands are added through reducers, non-reducer fields follow outermost-wins semantics.",
