      "id": "claim_a56ed60b4f4247afba9c18fc61586b16",
      "statement": "ModelRetryMiddleware wraps wrap_model_call to automatically retry model calls on transient errors with exponential backoff; supports custom exception filtering (tuple of exception types or callable predicate), configurable on_failure behavior (continue with error message, re-raise, or custom callable), and optional jitter to prevent thundering herd.",
