      "id": "claim_aab2cc6550404035b7e3d20943a3d2bd",
      "statement": "ToolErrorMiddleware intercepts wrap_tool_call to convert tool execution exceptions into error ToolMessages sent back to the model; on_error handler (sync or async) receives exception and ToolCallRequest and returns content (str or list of content blocks) to create the error message, or returns None to propagate the exception unchanged; handles only exceptions explicitly returned, propagating control-flow signals (interrupts, parent commands) unconditionally.",
